@SampleApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5249

### Get a user by id (IPipelink.Send)
GET {{SampleApi_HostAddress}}/user/1
Accept: application/json

### Stream users (IPipelink.SendStream)
GET {{SampleApi_HostAddress}}/users/stream?count=5
Accept: application/json

### Login (IPipelink.Send with a command)
POST {{SampleApi_HostAddress}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "secret"
}

### Publish user-created notification (IPipelink.Publish, fans out to 2 handlers)
POST {{SampleApi_HostAddress}}/users/42/created?email=user42@example.com
